    // The two budgets a whole suite gets that no other file does. A `describe`
    // or `test.describe` callback is a suite container, not a function anyone
    // reads top-to-bottom, so 630 rather than 115. This is scoped to every
    // suite rather than to vitest's block above: a Playwright `.spec.ts` is the
    // same shape, and scoping by runner is what left it at 115 before.
    {
      "files": [
        "**/*.test.ts",
        "**/*.test.tsx",
        "**/*.spec.ts",
        "**/*.spec.tsx",
